"Coils between the ice floes and sinks ships that come too close.",
"A giant of glacier and stone. Each step is a small earthquake.",
"Rides the avalanche down the mountain and arrives before the sound.",
"Always hungry, always cold. You hear its hooves before you see it.",
"Its wings are ribbons of the northern lights. It sings the long night away.",
"Her branches are thorny and frosted. Spring waits until she says so.",
"Scatters snow instead of sand. Everyone it touches dreams of winter.",
"Lives in the old iron stove. Feed it a log and it grants a warm wish.",
