"Covered in rime so thick it creaks. It feels nothing, not even the cold.",
"Lightning cracks between its tusks every time it trumpets.",
"Comes with chains and bells. Be good, or it comes for you.",
"A star burns on its forehead. It leads lost travellers out of the storm.",
"Hides in the mistletoe. Stand under it and it watches you.",
"Sleeps inside a crystal and dreams the snowflakes into shape.",
"The first fire ever lit. It has never gone out, not even for a moment.",
"Bites its own tail around the frozen world. If it lets go, the world ends.",
"The first giant. The mountains are what is left of his footsteps.",
"The winter that never ends. Three years of snow without a single summer.",
"The wolf that broke every chain. One day it will swallow the sun.",
"The northern lights themselves, given a body. The night sky bends around it.",
"The world tree. Its roots hold the nine worlds; its branches hold the stars.",
"She spins the threads of fate while you sleep. Every dream is one of her stitches.",
"The very first snowflake of the year. Make a wish when it lands.",
"Warm, sweet and always there for you after a cold day outside.",
"Lost in the snow, still waiting for its other half. It hasn't given up.",
}
